### Investigate Claude `--print --permission-mode plan` session persistence

**Status**: parked.

**Why parked**: symmetric to the Codex `--ephemeral` question above. The
`make review-plan-by-claude` target invokes `claude --print
--permission-mode plan` — session persistence behaviour for that
combination should be confirmed before any sensitive plan goes through
the loop.

**Triggers to pick up**: same triggers as the Codex `--ephemeral` entry.

**Rough effort**: ~30 minutes.

